     input and output and false if _c_r_p uses a single buffer.

     ccrryyppttoo__bbuuffffeerr__lleenn() returns the length of data buffer _c_b in bytes.

     ccrryyppttoo__aappppllyy__bbuuff() invokes a caller-supplied function to a region of the
     data buffer _c_b.  The function _f is called one or more times.  For each
